<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 175,000 tonnes soft wheat -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 175,000 tonnes soft wheat -trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 175,000 tonnes of soft wheat at $179.87 and $176.87 per tonne for October, November and December shipment at a tender on Thursday, traders told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Breakdown-</p>
<p>    tonnage	  shipment date	price</p>
<p>    25,000	  October 15-25	 $179.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  November 1-10	 $179.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  November 15-25	$179.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  December 1-10	 $179.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  December 15-25	$179.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  December 1-10	 $176.87</p>
<p>    25,000	  December 15-25	$176.87</p>
<p>The tender was for the purchase of five lots of 25,000 tonnes each. --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
